# Optional dependency for the `laya-server[laya]` extra: the real Laya engine.
# Pulls a heavy torch/transformers stack, so it is NOT part of the base install
# or CI (which run the deterministic FakeEngine). The accelerator-specific torch
# build is selected by the Docker image (ADR-0001).
# Compile to laya-requirements.txt with `make compile`.
laya
